{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36268","headline":"李户曹小妓天得善击越器以成曲章 · 方干","name":"李户曹小妓天得善击越器以成曲章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越器敲来曲调成，腕头匀滑自轻清。\n随风摇曳有余韵，测水浅深多泛声。\n昼漏丁当相续滴，寒蝉计会一时鸣。\n若教进上梨园去，衆乐无由更擅名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}